# oc-sim scenario v1
# SUPERSAW's input submenu (journal/D-036, D-037 revised): as supersaw.scn,
# but the submenu stays open on DETUNE, CV2 picked, at one volt. The snapshot
# shows the frame over the main screen: DETUNE and the 80 % played in its top
# edge; CV2 in a lit box, the scale and the shift; MIN, MAX, EFFECT ADD,
# CENTER; the CV bar, 1 V as a band from 0 V; the VAL bar, the panel's 60 %
# a tick and 80 % a block.
ticks 360
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
150 button down down
160 button down up
170 button down down
176 button down up
190 button left down
196 button left up
210 encoder 2 +12
220 encoder 1 +1
230 encoder 2 +10
240 button right down
246 button right up
260 encoder 2 +2
290 cv 2 1000
